    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover [The Fall], an intense arcade experience where you take on the role of a free-falling adventurer in an infinite universe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this endless runner game, every second is a battle against gravity. Skillfully dodge a series of unpredictable obstacles to extend your descent and beat your high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Infinite Fall &amp; Constant Challenge</strong> \u2013 Plunge into an endless descent where the terrain transforms in real-time. Your reflexes will be put to the test as you navigate through a variety of unexpected obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Fast-Paced &amp; Addictive Gameplay</strong> \u2013 With simple, intuitive controls, enjoy smooth and thrilling action that will keep you on the edge of your seat. Every decision matters as you push your limits and improve your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Challenges &amp; Competition</strong> \u2013 Beat your own records and challenge your friends to climb the leaderboard. Compete for higher scores in a global ranking system where every point counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>For All Players</strong> \u2013 Whether you're a casual gamer or a fan of intense challenges, <i>The Fall</i> offers a progressive difficulty system that adapts to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a breathtaking adventure where gravity is both your greatest enemy and your most powerful ally. Sharpen your reflexes, master the fall, and become the ultimate high-score champion in <i>The Fall</i>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover [The Fall], an intense arcade experience where you take on the role of a free-falling adventurer in an infinite universe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this endless runner game, every second is a battle against gravity. Skillfully dodge a series of unpredictable obstacles to extend your descent and beat your high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Infinite Fall &amp; Constant Challenge</strong> \u2013 Plunge into an endless descent where the terrain transforms in real-time. Your reflexes will be put to the test as you navigate through a variety of unexpected obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Fast-Paced &amp; Addictive Gameplay</strong> \u2013 With simple, intuitive controls, enjoy smooth and thrilling action that will keep you on the edge of your seat. Every decision matters as you push your limits and improve your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Challenges &amp; Competition</strong> \u2013 Beat your own records and challenge your friends to climb the leaderboard. Compete for higher scores in a global ranking system where every point counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>For All Players</strong> \u2013 Whether you're a casual gamer or a fan of intense challenges, <i>The Fall</i> offers a progressive difficulty system that adapts to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a breathtaking adventure where gravity is both your greatest enemy and your most powerful ally. Sharpen your reflexes, master the fall, and become the ultimate high-score champion in <i>The Fall</i>!</p>",
